# Copy to .secrets and fill in the credentials you actually use.
#
# Same KEY=value format as .env, but every key carries a SECRET_ prefix on top
# of the usual ALEXANDRIA_ prefix. The loader strips SECRET_ and feeds the rest
# through the normal settings machinery, so SECRET_ALEXANDRIA_OPENROUTER_API_KEY
# populates the same `openrouter_api_key` setting that .env used to.
#
# Precedence: process environment > .secrets > .env > code defaults.
# Keys without the SECRET_ prefix are ignored, as are keys that don't match a
# setting in pka/config.py (both are logged as warnings).
#
# .secrets is git-ignored. Never commit it.

# ── Model providers ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Ollama Cloud — only for ALEXANDRIA_*_PROVIDER=ollama_cloud (direct to
# ollama.com). Create the key at https://ollama.com/settings/keys. Not needed
# for the `ollama signin` route, where the local daemon holds the credential.
# SECRET_ALEXANDRIA_OLLAMA_CLOUD_API_KEY=...
# SECRET_ALEXANDRIA_OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-...
# SECRET_ALEXANDRIA_OVH_API_KEY=...

# ── Reddit saved posts ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SECRET_ALEXANDRIA_REDDIT_CLIENT_ID=
# SECRET_ALEXANDRIA_REDDIT_CLIENT_SECRET=
# SECRET_ALEXANDRIA_REDDIT_PASSWORD=
# SECRET_ALEXANDRIA_REDDIT_REFRESH_TOKEN=
